  "records": [
    {
      "id": "i01",
      "section": "motivation",
      "text": "On the largest scales, cosmology expects the universe to look the same in every direction.",
      "word_count": 15,
      "raw_file": "audio_v5/raw/i01-50b6c1cb04f9.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "316d9b1e72105b753d433f03748359cd90433d740f76ed74f2252d0f92643292",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v5/decoded/i01.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "5ad256bcc58ec0a26a5747b53cf9f2a6c3fde01c36d7705e52cf84f8bcc48ada",
      "audio_start_sample": 28800,
      "audio_end_sample": 267264,
      "audio_start_seconds": 0.6,
      "audio_end_seconds": 5.568,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 18,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 0.6,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": 0.0,
      "pause_after_samples": 36000,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.75
    },
    {
      "id": "i02",
      "section": "motivation",
      "text": "A conceptual sky of spiral galaxies should therefore show no built-in preference for clockwise or anticlockwise winding.",
      "word_count": 17,
      "raw_file": "audio_v5/raw/i02-db0be38e5a64.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "c6075c6c408a95352da79b2a947096e50ecf98e0676d12b20a3cb8bedcc217bb",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v5/decoded/i02.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "dc63ded508407b653d598634455b577e0c63fd9721327cb28da631a027674b3c",
      "audio_start_sample": 303264,
      "audio_end_sample": 641952,
      "audio_start_seconds": 6.318,
      "audio_end_seconds": 13.374,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 190,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 6.333333333333333,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": 0.015333333333333421,
      "pause_after_samples": 179422,
      "pause_after_seconds": 3.7379583333333333
    },
    {
      "id": "i03",
      "section": "motivation",
      "text": "Galaxies acquire angular momentum while surrounding structure grows, so balance is the prediction, not an accident.",
      "word_count": 16,
      "raw_file": "audio_v5/raw/i03-7b63a9b9c192.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "7a2856db533ffd1f3b2c41510430ebc30c1ded35952d450be5a25cdfe013f56c",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v5/decoded/i03.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "025931eb3070c084ba72265f3f4bef7cb3667fc6e20c234189b715cfffa2740d",
      "audio_start_sample": 821374,
      "audio_end_sample": 1145086,
      "audio_start_seconds": 17.111958333333334,
      "audio_end_seconds": 23.855958333333334,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 513,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 17.1,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": -0.011958333333332405,
      "pause_after_samples": 179421,
      "pause_after_seconds": 3.7379375
    },
    {
      "id": "i04",
      "section": "motivation",
      "text": "A preference for spiral galaxies in one sector of the sky to be left-handed or right-handed spirals would indicate a parity violating asymmetry in the overall universe and a preferred axis.",
      "word_count": 31,
      "raw_file": "audio_v5/raw/i04-2e44c9feaac7.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "fa94f8db4e837d8d1c6dacd98fd858e3ec76130875bf61cb674a9d651cc94c04",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v5/decoded/i04.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "848806795a5f7d343d434a0cb005572ebca86b2f9e7eeab3869f8a4bb2ee9be3",
      "audio_start_sample": 1324507,
      "audio_end_sample": 1817563,
      "audio_start_seconds": 27.593895833333335,
      "audio_end_seconds": 37.86589583333333,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 828,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 27.6,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": 0.006104166666666799,
      "pause_after_samples": 179421,
      "pause_after_seconds": 3.7379375
    },
    {
      "id": "i05l",
      "section": "motivation",
      "text": "Longo reported: An unbinned analysis for a dipole component that made no prior assumptions for the dipole axis gives a dipole asymmetry of \u22120.0408\u00b10.011 with a probability of occurring by chance of 7.9\u00d710\u207b\u2074.",
      "word_count": 39,
      "raw_file": "audio_v5/raw/i05l-776d132d23c1.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "2b0f46d137e43c904726be5c50e831ea97a8a116f69b6f5824eeec7a794b4cf9",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v5/decoded/i05l.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "7211a7e5eb6e0b051036609c88f9c9e29d9ea2d1efbf29af2a6a1c286b7e60cd",
      "audio_start_sample": 1996984,
      "audio_end_sample": 2892088,
      "audio_start_seconds": 41.603833333333334,
      "audio_end_seconds": 60.25183333333333,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 1248,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 41.6,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": -0.003833333333332689,
      "pause_after_samples": 36000,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.75
    },
    {
      "id": "i05s",
      "section": "motivation",
      "text": "Shamir reported: The results show that the local universe (z<0.3) is not isotropic in terms of galaxy spin, with probability P<5.8\u00d710\u207b\u2076 of such asymmetry to occur by chance.",
      "word_count": 34,
      "raw_file": "audio_v5/raw/i05s-c6ba0f9a82ec.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "ff6b595e74135b4cbe48b1649bd72d254361fb3d2325dececcb3e4e215b83450",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v5/decoded/i05s.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "4624483fde1d8dc12bf556d8e9a68eb9e83d541db17c4163aafa3035a84cfc3f",
      "audio_start_sample": 2928088,
      "audio_end_sample": 3593944,
      "audio_start_seconds": 61.00183333333333,
      "audio_end_seconds": 74.87383333333334,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 1830,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 61.0,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": -0.0018333333333302448,
      "pause_after_samples": 36000,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.75
    },
    {
      "id": "i05d",
      "section": "motivation",
      "text": "Land and colleagues reported: After establishing and correcting for a certain level of bias in our handedness results we find the winding sense of the galaxies to be consistent with statistical isotropy.",
      "word_count": 32,
      "raw_file": "audio_v5/raw/i05d-43f7a971b4e0.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "0ab844a0efa6729305750ff856891fa9395e38926af5fe3f75de61f3ab40be2c",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v5/decoded/i05d.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "f3f8631d13d1ec72c1ef784b7971447058ddc0fa6bc242047faf4469db1b4ca4",
      "audio_start_sample": 3629944,
      "audio_end_sample": 4143736,
      "audio_start_seconds": 75.62383333333334,
      "audio_end_seconds": 86.32783333333333,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 2269,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 75.63333333333334,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": 0.009500000000002728,
      "pause_after_samples": 36000,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.75
    },
    {
      "id": "i05u",
      "section": "motivation",
      "text": "These studies reported incompatible answers, so the literature remains disputed; this video adopts none of them as its finding.",
      "word_count": 19,
      "raw_file": "audio_v5/raw/i05u-5d5ed85e1f37.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "c46f44d48b428af27c12bcaff5271ea97908bbf781e0e2eba387e184c3661276",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v5/decoded/i05u.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "49614c41298ddd1e55b2f9ab36564808f3051bbc636440adf2de0346ab5ea87c",
      "audio_start_sample": 4179736,
      "audio_end_sample": 4540312,
      "audio_start_seconds": 87.07783333333333,
      "audio_end_seconds": 94.58983333333333,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 2612,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 87.06666666666666,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": -0.01116666666666788,
      "pause_after_samples": 179421,
      "pause_after_seconds": 3.7379375
    },
    {
      "id": "i06",
      "section": "motivation",
      "text": "The catch is that people and algorithms can carry a left-right sorting bias, so the same images need a mirror control.",
      "word_count": 21,
      "raw_file": "audio_v5/raw/i06-b6ba11c74ba5.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "610a0607d0e038a117beeda9576dfba9b0558f8f278056d8d443c30a6f769987",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v5/decoded/i06.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "30f9822e07b536304cb8adfabcaed223137809ba79512cd1ffce2ac96ddb4c24",
      "audio_start_sample": 4719733,
      "audio_end_sample": 5059573,
      "audio_start_seconds": 98.32777083333333,
      "audio_end_seconds": 105.40777083333333,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 2950,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 98.33333333333333,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": 0.005562499999996362,
      "pause_after_samples": 179421,
      "pause_after_seconds": 3.7379375
    },
    {
      "id": "s02",
      "section": "question",
      "text": "Can an apparent imbalance between clockwise and anticlockwise labels be separated from one introduced by the labeling process?",
      "word_count": 18,
      "raw_file": "audio_v5/raw/s02-ee829c9ef24e.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "42fe4e520e2fd0a7ae0de25a7c1bc0dda2f72cd93976f6e63b4bd82ad535f874",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v5/decoded/s02.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "b4962dc5d2918046c20bc6345cdbe34336b1d367a1d24ddf0e9a8a38c28b2d6d",
      "audio_start_sample": 5238994,
      "audio_end_sample": 5589202,
      "audio_start_seconds": 109.14570833333333,
      "audio_end_seconds": 116.44170833333334,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 3274,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 109.13333333333334,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": -0.012374999999991587,
      "pause_after_samples": 179421,
      "pause_after_seconds": 3.7379375
    },
    {
      "id": "s03",
      "section": "two-worlds",
      "text": "Two explanations can create the same apparent imbalance.",
      "word_count": 8,
      "raw_file": "audio_v5/raw/s03-2654139c78f3.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "87ef912035fd95327979b57f11fb15a9b0ba867248994bcd8f324dc57405c173",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v5/decoded/s03.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "4d11eb1e01108c27c5ab5a45904b407364b95453788e8b1e27336e00f3c9c4ca",
      "audio_start_sample": 5768623,
      "audio_end_sample": 5948335,
      "audio_start_seconds": 120.17964583333334,
      "audio_end_seconds": 123.92364583333334,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 3605,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 120.16666666666667,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": -0.012979166666667652,
      "pause_after_samples": 36000,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.75
    },
    {
      "id": "s04",
      "section": "two-worlds",
      "text": "One places the pattern in the images.",
      "word_count": 7,
      "raw_file": "audio_v5/raw/s04-c2f6b0727d04.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "0735f5db1d7dd967f689a6ec28639239bafc1b3aa8ffea913d961583ffaaaf9d",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v5/decoded/s04.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "1b2ebf5f86c4a7791995d3a53a1e4e5b9ded75acba7916db453e0d057e53c8f5",
      "audio_start_sample": 5984335,
      "audio_end_sample": 6121423,
      "audio_start_seconds": 124.67364583333334,
      "audio_end_seconds": 127.52964583333333,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 3740,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 124.66666666666667,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": -0.006979166666667425,
      "pause_after_samples": 36000,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.75
    },
    {
      "id": "s05",
      "section": "two-worlds",
      "text": "The other places it in the labeling process.",
      "word_count": 8,
      "raw_file": "audio_v5/raw/s05-798294462935.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "e25fa3d454cb7151d2cd76b20f5cc1c4a8edb39d26cc21b662cce3a1603b0c14",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v5/decoded/s05.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "83c1c04bb38f193ed48ef43428c01b09cf4530e1712bc05f404080c5e7ee0d2a",
      "audio_start_sample": 6157423,
      "audio_end_sample": 6281839,
      "audio_start_seconds": 128.27964583333332,
      "audio_end_seconds": 130.87164583333333,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 3848,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 128.26666666666668,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": -0.01297916666663923,
      "pause_after_samples": 179421,
      "pause_after_seconds": 3.7379375
    },
    {
      "id": "s06",
      "section": "mirror-climax",
      "text": "Apply one decisive test to both worlds: mirror the same conceptual spiral horizontally.",
      "word_count": 13,
      "raw_file": "audio_v5/raw/s06-ddb7198d6964.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "c019fccc6882eb9b319ae0915d758f4a56190ce3f42df7bd1461e9017a39076a",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v5/decoded/s06.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "06b5a4c2cff06feaafe40da21fb893bd57f56d02390fdf0879fbb444518fc465",
      "audio_start_sample": 6461260,
      "audio_end_sample": 6759628,
      "audio_start_seconds": 134.60958333333335,
      "audio_end_seconds": 140.82558333333333,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 4038,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 134.6,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": -0.009583333333353039,
      "pause_after_samples": 36000,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.75
    },
    {
      "id": "s07",
      "section": "mirror-climax",
      "text": "The geometry reverses, and its apparent label inverts from clockwise to anticlockwise.",
      "word_count": 12,
      "raw_file": "audio_v5/raw/s07-4ec7573b3247.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "2f0b36c5d855d740a080394bbf93d51ab6c1faf38d21527157a2891333b9f8c8",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v5/decoded/s07.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "4e17b05322a74fda1f0b2d3f854ef06409063dd63aa664e68ba323d0f2f5e939",
      "audio_start_sample": 6795628,
      "audio_end_sample": 7067500,
      "audio_start_seconds": 141.57558333333333,
      "audio_end_seconds": 147.23958333333334,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 4247,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 141.56666666666666,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": -0.008916666666664241,
      "pause_after_samples": 36000,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.75
    },
    {
      "id": "s08",
      "section": "mirror-climax",
      "text": "If the pattern belongs to the images themselves, it must follow that inversion.",
      "word_count": 13,
      "raw_file": "audio_v5/raw/s08-b7adc8ea224c.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "e3b2d9a0ef43898a9bd119e76266b8c1204818e49c1890ab0426baca875cecb1",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v5/decoded/s08.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "2da530b128c382b5b537302da18a7244c4bc6aa3c1ec755550aa522134fbae92",
      "audio_start_sample": 7103500,
      "audio_end_sample": 7295884,
      "audio_start_seconds": 147.98958333333334,
      "audio_end_seconds": 151.99758333333332,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 4440,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 148.0,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": 0.010416666666657193,
      "pause_after_samples": 36000,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.75
    },
    {
      "id": "s09",
      "section": "mirror-climax",
      "text": "If it entered through the labeling process instead, it need not follow the pixels.",
      "word_count": 14,
      "raw_file": "audio_v5/raw/s09-0de62cff2934.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "dacb1c93b393068a332219fcb02bc9bb0c9bc08e7217d1880ec3fbe66606897e",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v5/decoded/s09.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "7ad7c04bbeaea04f7ea84ea8c1d1e9f52fe50b0565ab214de283085b9f3e7128",
      "audio_start_sample": 7331884,
      "audio_end_sample": 7551916,
      "audio_start_seconds": 152.74758333333332,
      "audio_end_seconds": 157.33158333333333,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 4582,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 152.73333333333332,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": -0.014250000000004093,
      "pause_after_samples": 36000,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.75
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "section": "mirror-climax",
      "text": "One mirror, two incompatible predicted behaviors: that difference is the scientific discriminant.",
      "word_count": 12,
      "raw_file": "audio_v5/raw/s10-3b19d3104719.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "fa851a12f4e2102d58ec5c7f2bb4acabdd392abdf88208975ede181940f9df65",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v5/decoded/s10.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "3698d057ac1ef30cc3d9b6c7a9526f28fb63621ebe5d4daddd200069aaee56b8",
      "audio_start_sample": 7587916,
      "audio_end_sample": 7924300,
      "audio_start_seconds": 158.08158333333333,
      "audio_end_seconds": 165.08958333333334,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 4742,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 158.06666666666666,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": -0.014916666666664469,
      "pause_after_samples": 179421,
      "pause_after_seconds": 3.7379375
    },
    {
      "id": "s11",
      "section": "discipline",
      "text": "Before any number was computed, we fixed the mirror logic, every cut, both thresholds, and paired comparisons.",
      "word_count": 17,
      "raw_file": "audio_v5/raw/s11-1d072584576a.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "f3374f86d87b37f38f04cdb5d66e6c2f976307caf77cbbf501b38212713e0a2a",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v5/decoded/s11.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "bc0c739e5292acef0f3db6f87d3fec04adfc9bb0b01989fa25b1452783f90447",
      "audio_start_sample": 8103721,
      "audio_end_sample": 8419369,
      "audio_start_seconds": 168.82752083333332,
      "audio_end_seconds": 175.40352083333335,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 5065,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 168.83333333333334,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": 0.005812500000018872,
      "pause_after_samples": 179421,
      "pause_after_seconds": 3.7379375
    },
    {
      "id": "s12",
      "section": "funnel",
      "text": "The frozen Galaxy Zoo 1 source contains 667,944 rows.",
      "word_count": 10,
      "raw_file": "audio_v5/raw/s12-390ca91eca91.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "9809de12953816842e42460cfd69389645393ce744287d5a29de505c21ba27c8",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v5/decoded/s12.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "3bbba278a8ea09b2469aec49ca18f8d77a44507f11e4b8822250bc0687d75a1e",
      "audio_start_sample": 8598790,
      "audio_end_sample": 8908678,
      "audio_start_seconds": 179.14145833333333,
      "audio_end_seconds": 185.59745833333332,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 5374,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 179.13333333333333,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": -0.008125000000006821,
      "pause_after_samples": 36000,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.75
    },
    {
      "id": "s13",
      "section": "funnel",
      "text": "Three parallel readouts apply the spiral flag and two frozen thresholds; exact counts stay attached to their branches.",
      "word_count": 18,
      "raw_file": "audio_v5/raw/s13-1a27c2ca9817.mp3",
